<title>JAPAN: Hokushin - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokushin - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.39		vs	    5.98</p>
<p> Operating	  286 million	 vs	  381 million</p>
<p> Current	    332 million	 vs	  500 million</p>
<p> Net		  144 million	 vs	  273 million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.04 yen	  vs	    9.83 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokushin Co Ltd is a leading medium-density fibreboard maker.</p>
</text>
